    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparisons",
     "texto": [
      "**-den/-dan** can mark the point of comparison: **Ali Ayşe'den daha kısa** = Ali is shorter than Ayşe.",
      "**en** expresses the highest degree: **en çalışkan öğrenci** = the most hard-working student. Vowel harmony chooses the form of the suffix."
     ],
